'' declined (TKO0994) and 'dim as T v = x' read a garbage length. fbc-modern prints the same.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/ctor-string-default-arg.tiko -o tests/codegen/ctorstringdefaultarg.exe
